index fa1a2d5..ca0667e 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -8,6 +8,11 @@ package, not for somebody reading this repository's commit log.
 
 ## [Unreleased]
 
+### Changed
+
+- Registering a tool with an invalid static JSON Schema now fails immediately and names the tool, so schema mistakes surface when the application starts.
+- Tool calls that fail the registered input schema now return a result describing the failing field and constraint, allowing the model to correct the call within the tool-round limit. Executors receive only schema-valid input; an executor that previously handled malformed input itself will no longer see those calls.
+
